      *; call: CALL PGM({lib}/{name}) PARM('ABC' 41.5)
      * The program status data structure and *ENTRY parameters.
     H
     FQSYSPRT O   F     132     OF     PRINTER
     IPSDS       SDS
     I                                     *PROGRAM PGMNAM
     I                                     *STATUS  STS
     I                                     *PARMS   PRMS
     I                                     *ROUTINE RTN
     C           *ENTRY    PLIST
     C                     PARM           P1      3
     C                     PARM           P2     155
     C                     ADD  1         P2
     C                     EXCPTLINE
     C                     SETON                     LR
     OQSYSPRT E  1             LINE
     O                         PGMNAM    10
     O                         STS       20
     O                         PRMS  Z   25
     O                         RTN       35
     O                         P1        40
     O                         P2    J   65
